19-Sep-2026  0.92.2 Security hardening: saved-connection Name validation and
                    Obey field sanitising, so a crafted connection cannot escape
                    its directory or inject a launch command; plus two bounds
                    checks in the core RDP / certificate parsing. The Window /
                    Full window / Full screen entries are grouped under a
